join detective right
detective (speaking): What do you know about Andrei?
join cook left
cook (speaking): The guard?
cook: As far as I'm aware, they're just a one-night hire, here to keep watch over who enters and exits the dinner party, and make sure everything is safe.
cook (unamused): Though they can't have been very good at their job, considering... you know.
cook (squinting): Unless of course, they *were* the killer.
cook (speaking): But anyway, that's your expertise. Go and find your evidence.
